Z||000054||Jncomutt||12-03-2001||01:55 AM||||I really hope that scooter thing isn't it.  After all this time of anticipation, he plans to release a product that won't make it in the real world.  It was stated he believes cities and parks will use these rather than cars or golf-cart type vehicles.  Thats garbage.  Didn't this guy realize that it rains.  Even if it was waterproof (which I doubt) what city man in his buiness suit wants to get wet.  And the snow?  It sure as heck doens't have the kick-butt heater my fiero does.  <P>Perhaps a small little accessory, such as a luxary for the wealthier type, like bill gates, to get from one side of his house to the other.  But a replacement to cars, this is not.<P>And besides, its plastic.  "You'll die crossing streets on that deathtrap"  And what if it has electrical fires?  "Oh yea, those things, they catch on fire right?"  And I wonder what they have for electric motors..  "The motor is where in those?"<BR>And I'm sure all parts aren't from the US.  "Yea, way to support asia with your Jap Crap,"  Then you point to the back.<P>Wow, sorta sounds like the last invention this huge.  All just big misconseptions, Hope this one doens't get halted after only 4 years.||||reg||1
